#. module: xlsx_template_report
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_xlsx_template_report
msgid ""
"# Excel Template Reports\n"
"\n"
"Design a report in your own Excel file — colours, number formats, formulas,\n"
"PivotTables — and let Odoo fill in the data.\n"
"\n"
"* Each data source fills a sheet with the same name, as an Excel table:\n"
"  `=SUM(sales[amount_total])` keeps working whatever the number of rows.\n"
"* Records, grouped totals, or read-only SQL (administrators only).\n"
"* Relative periods: yesterday, last week, month to date, last quarter...\n"
"* Data is always read with the access rights of the \"Run as\" user.\n"
"\n"
"Scheduling and delivery by email or Telegram: **Excel Template Reports Pro**.\n"
msgstr ""

